<div class="lazyblock-home-seventh-section-Z1c5GTn wp-block-lazyblock-home-seventh-section">
    <section class="TestimonialSection com60 position-relative light pb-0">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row testiFirst mb-30">
                <div class="col-md-50 pr-30">
                    <div class="boxCOntents">
                        <div class="tstBox">
                            <div class="CMBName">Sachin Rajaram</div>
                            <span class="d-block smFont">TMW Worldwide</span>
                            <span class="smFont">Media Manager</span>
                            <p class="pt-20">I have worked in the media industry for over a decade and I have to say that Sustainable Mindz is the best media firm in Dubai I have come across. The quality of their work is top-notch and their rates are more than reasonable. The fact that they are constantly innovating with new tech, but never at the expense of quality, is what makes them so great!</p>
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mt-30">
                                <span>5 Excellent</span>
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="129" height="26" fill="none">
