                                </svg>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="tstBox">
                            <div class="CMBName">Tammy Tusek</div>
                            <span class="d-block smFont">Manthena American School</span>
                            <span class="smFont">Principal</span>
                            <p class="pt-20">I had a brief opportunity to work with Sustainable Mindz but was confident in their expertise and creativity, especially in branding. They were well-rounded in the demands of multiple markets and how to take a 360 approach from strategy to implementation with results. I highly recommend this digital marketing agency in UAE.</p>
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mt-30">
                                <span>5 Excellent</span>
