                                </svg>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="tstBox">
                            <div class="CMBName">Azim Punnilath Ummer</div>
                            <span class="d-block smFont">Lulu Exchange</span>
                            <span class="smFont">Media &amp; Marketing Manager</span>
                            <p class="pt-20">I &#8217;ve been working with Sustainable Mindz for over a year now and they are great. It is as if they can take on any project. They possess all the creative skills that make them stand out from the competition. Their customer service is great &#8211; they handheld us across every project and helped us emerge successful.</p>
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mt-30">
                                <span>5 Excellent</span>
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="129" height="26" fill="none">
