                                </svg>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="tstBox">
                            <div class="CMBName">Prathish Cherian</div>
                            <span class="d-block smFont">Masscom Global</span>
                            <span class="smFont">General Manager</span>
                            <p class="pt-20">I have been working with Sustainable Mindz for the last 2 years, and would recommend them to anyone in my network. They are always willing to go the extra mile for their clients, and make sure that we are fully satisfied with their work. I &#8217;ve seen a lot of agencies in dubai come and go, but this is one company you can always count on delivering the best quality work.</p>
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mt-30">
